~ start
Scott: [[Hi|Yo|Howdy]], My Order is {{drink_list}}
do _add_recipt()
set speaking_title = "mid"
=> END
~ mid
Scott: GET IT DONE
=> END
~ finish
Scott: Finished
=> END
