~ Positive
set emo = "happy"
Scott: Solid stuff, Thanks man
do _give_payment()
=> END

~ Negative
set emo = "mad"
Scott: Damn this taste like crap, I'm not definitely not tipping
do _give_payment()
=> END

~ Mid
Scott: I mean, it's aight but feels overpriced
do _give_payment()
=> END

~ TimeWarning1
Scott: Damn bartender, you making the spirits by hand or something? What's taking so long
=> END

